Dependencies: Context

Purpose:
  Defines context dependency graph, invalidation rules, and
  context fingerprinting.

ContextDependencyGraph:
  TASK-1023
    ↓
  PAYMENTS
    ↓
  REFUND
    ├── service.go
    ├── repository.go
    ├── refund_test.go
    ├── idempotency.sdd
    └── payment-security.sdd

ContextFingerprint:
  Format:
    CTX-XXXX

  Metadata:
    project: <name>
    task: <id>
    skills: <count>
    docs: <count>
    source: <count>
    workflow: <stage>

ContextInvalidation:
  Trigger:
    - Source code change
    - .sdd change
    - Architecture change
    - Skill update

  Process:
    SOURCE CHANGE
      ↓
    DEPENDENCY GRAPH
      ↓
    INVALIDATE
      ↓
    REBUILD CONTEXT

InvalidationScope:
  repository.go changed:
    - repository.sdd
    - refund docs
    - refund tests
    - dependent tasks

ContextAudit:
  Format:
    CTX-<ID>

  Loaded:
    - TASK-<ID>
    - TASK-<ID>
    - <layer>/<domain>/<module>/<artifact>
    - <test-path>
    - <skill>.sdd
    - <skill>.sdd

  Excluded:
    - frontend
    - mobile
    - unrelated domains

  Note:
    Full prompt/history NOT stored (token/storage saving).

State: +
  